#: nitrogen/config/nitrogenconfigurationui.cpp:166
msgid "Extra Size grip display:"
msgstr "Gröttgreep wiesen:"

#: nitrogen/config/nitrogenconfigurationui.cpp:170
msgid ""
"The extra size grip is a small triangle shown in the bottom-right corner of "
"a window \n"
"which allows to resize the window. This option controls in which case this "
"size grip \n"
"is shown."
msgstr ""
"De Gröttgreep is en lütt Dre'eck nerrn rechts binnen elkeen Finster, mit dat "
"sik de \n"
"Finstergrött topassen. Hier kannst Du fastleggen, wannehr de Greep wiest "
"warrt."

#: nitrogen/config/nitrogenconfigurationui.cpp:182
msgid "Outline active window title"
msgstr "Ümreet för aktiev Finstertitel"

#: nitrogen/config/nitrogenconfigurationui.cpp:185
msgid ""
"When enabled, an additional frame is shown around the active window as well "
"as its title"
msgstr "Wenn anmaakt, hett dat aktive Finster un ok sien Titel en Rahmen bito"

#: nitrogen/config/nitrogenconfigurationui.cpp:188
msgid "Draw separator between title bar and active window contents"
msgstr ""
"Trennbalken twischen Titelbalken un den Inholt vun't aktive Finster wiesen"

#: nitrogen/config/nitrogenconfigurationui.cpp:191
msgid ""
"When enabled, this option makes an horizontal separator appear between the "
"window title bar and the window contents."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, gifft dat en kimmrecht Trennbalken twischen den Titelbalken un "
"den Finsterinholt."

#: nitrogen/config/nitrogenconfigurationui.cpp:194
msgid "Glow active window"
msgstr "Aktiev Finster glönig maken"

#: nitrogen/config/nitrogenconfigurationui.cpp:197
msgid ""
"When this option is enabled, oxygen signature blue glow is used for the "
"active window shadow."
msgstr ""
"Is dit anmaakt, warrt de Finsterschadden mit Oxygen sien Kennmark-Blaag "
"infarvt."

